abstract: >
  Model Context Protocol server, REST API and browser interface for five
  DOI-versioned astrophysical kinematic corpora (2,064 objects, z = 0 to 5.68)
  with FAISS semantic search, start-up data-integrity checks and provenance
  in every response.
keywords:
  - Model Context Protocol
  - astrostatistics
  - FAISS
  - semantic search
  - galaxy kinematics
